# Kanban prior lessons gate

Before **Decisions** / **Corrective Action** on **feature** / **bug** / **agent** (or **commit-issue**
review): [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Prior lessons gate.
Signatures: `lessons-by-area-routing`, `governance-index-not-grep`.

**Read order:** `docs/lessons-index.yaml` → triage reference § Lessons by area →
`resolve_prior_lessons.py` → named done card only if still ambiguous — **no** broad `done/` grep.
Forward-feedback ranking: `forward-feedback-index.yaml` (not prior-lessons). Record
`**Prior lessons (YYYY-MM-DD):**` on card — C4 cite formats: [reference.md § Prior lessons gate](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md#prior-lessons-gate).

**Do not:** skip gate; duplicate **Fix pattern** prose — cite **Signature** or done-card stem only.
